{"time": 1763012790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1693304820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "（先继续）"}
{"time": 1763012877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "942424680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“我不像叔叔那样热爱读书，平时也不会到书房去，所以不太清楚，一会儿我带你们去看看书房或许能发现些什么\""}
{"time": 1763012892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "103892795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“那再好不过了”"}
{"time": 1763012901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1042592482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1397161995"}, "sender": {"id": "1397161995", "name": "江太太太太太白"}, "message": "“好的”"}
{"time": 1763012941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596925364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1005826077]\"那些书对我来说也不是什么太重要的东西，不过毕竟是叔叔的遗物，我最多也就能给到10美元了”"}
{"time": 1763012955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "244071010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“另外我还想问问，你对道格拉斯先生的失踪有什么头绪嘛？”"}
{"time": 1763013061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "952927949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“没有，他一直以来只对读书比较上心，脾气又很古怪，很少跟人来往，去年他失踪还是我被通知来继承房子的时候才知道‘"}
{"time": 1763013254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1186795218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“那事不宜迟，我们先去书房调查一下吧”#前往书房"}
{"time": 1763013276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1915690926", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1397161995"}, "sender": {"id": "1397161995", "name": "江太太太太太白"}, "message": "#跟随"}
{"time": 1763013378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1290958233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "”在那之前，你们先看看这张照片，这是我叔叔留下的最后一张照片，可能对你们有帮助”托马斯拿出来一张照片，里面是个秃顶白发，戴着圆框眼镜的老人"}
{"time": 1763013451, "type": "recv", "message_id": "107815312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#接过照片，细细端详照片里的绅士"}
