{"time": 1763016132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1373582341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "速子大大咧咧的，甚至没有察觉对方的皱眉"}
{"time": 1763016175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "818081664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“就是去年失踪的那位，他的侄子金博尔先生委托我们来寻找他叔叔的行踪”"}
{"time": 1763016230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1829708281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“这我就有印象了，听闻他是个古怪的人，甚至会半夜到墓地里坐在墓碑上读书”"}
{"time": 1763016286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1206667485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“所以你们想找关于墓地的新闻是为了这个？”"}
{"time": 1763016299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "402468871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“墓地上读书？那块墓地有什么特殊的嘛？”"}
{"time": 1763016361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "116773014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“这我就不清楚了，毕竟我不负责这些奇闻异事”"}
{"time": 1763016412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2034958099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#乐呵呵地陪笑“我的同伴有些大大咧咧，我想先生的好心肠肯定会原谅她的。”"}
{"time": 1763016435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "615697194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“小问题，我没放心上，不过你们可以查阅一下往期报刊，说不定会有相关报道”"}
{"time": 1763016444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "696179619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“这么说，报社有人专门负责这些奇闻异事的人嘛？”"}
