{"time": 1763017304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "995860090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#阅读旧刊，寻找在这个小镇发生过的奇闻异事"}
{"time": 1763017312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1980641874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "其中一份日期显示是10年前，有人声称在毗邻金博尔家的墓地里有一群未着寸缕的人在墓地里狂欢嬉戏"}
{"time": 1763017347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1431514222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "另一份是一位记者留下的笔记"}
{"time": 1763017391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1760127083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "这份记录没有发表"}
{"time": 1763017439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442716540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "其中有一段与墓地相关的陈述，来自现年 64 岁，患有失眠症的邻居希尔达·沃德女士。"}
{"time": 1763017522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1846964860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "她表示在她生活的20多年里时常会发现“魔鬼的子嗣”出没在墓地附近"}
{"time": 1763017589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "300362865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“魔鬼的子嗣”外观与人类似，但是有犬类特征，足部呈蹄状，浑身沾满腐烂的泥土"}
{"time": 1763017662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "737394214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "采访结尾记者写到“沃德女士已经搬去了底特律，其他邻居却都表示不曾见过所谓的魔鬼子嗣”"}
{"time": 1763017765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1878873321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“先生你有去那片墓地看过嘛？我听说墓地下面藏有隐蔽地隧道？”#询问约翰先生"}
{"time": 1763017827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1020323438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1397161995"}, "sender": {"id": "1397161995", "name": "江太太太太太白"}, "message": "#尝试用神秘学理解这种生物"}
