{"time": 1763018515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1597610292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1397161995"}, "sender": {"id": "1397161995", "name": "江太太太太太白"}, "message": "#我跟在约瑟夫后面"}
{"time": 1763018595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "696329329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“你们好，请问两位先生有什么要事吗”午饭时间刚刚过去，警察局里也没什么人，值班的治安官接待了你们"}
{"time": 1763018651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "242653670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“你好警察先生，我们接受了委托，想来询问一年前失踪的道格拉斯先生的线索”"}
{"time": 1763018772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1810010829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“老金博尔？”"}
{"time": 1763018793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1852033177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1397161995"}, "sender": {"id": "1397161995", "name": "江太太太太太白"}, "message": "#点头"}
{"time": 1763018793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "487308791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“对的，就是金波尔先生的叔叔”"}
{"time": 1763018860, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1704065884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“我记得，之前他侄子搬过来的时候也到处张贴过寻人启事。但是这么久没有消息，我们知道的也不比你们多”"}
{"time": 1763018923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "479037681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1064688367", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“我想警察先生你们肯定多多少少调查了些什么，能否让我们看一看当年的档案？”"}
